From: Lucas McDonald <lucasmcdonald3@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Dec 2025 10:38:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat!: updates to the S3 Encryption Client (#70)

* Updates to the S3 Encryption Client

## Breaking Changes

The S3 Encryption Client now requires key committing algorithm suites by default.

See migration guide: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-s3-encryption-client/latest/developerguide/go-v4-migration.html
